                                                "sense_id": "323cb9c8-a666-37d4-94f0-5ddf4225150f",
                                                "text": "The church dores were sparred,\nFast boltyd and barryd,\nYet wyth a prety gyn\nI fortuned to come in, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e32f63af-5e1f-48dc-82bc-c01b2a774480",
                                                "sense_id": "323cb9c8-a666-37d4-94f0-5ddf4225150f",
                                                "text": "treason and deceiptfull gin"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f398f32-4bc8-37b3-953a-1aee018410de",
                                        "entry_id": "94899858-ca98-37b5-a614-143ab82bd353",
